# Cost Seg Smart branded referral link (Strategy brief, 2026-07-30). Ref code
# + UTM params defined ONCE here — editing the destination means editing
# these two lines, nowhere else. :placement forwards from the path into
# utm_content so each surface (partner page, intel article, email footer, a
# 1:1 send) is distinguishable in Cost Seg Smart's own UTM reporting.
# Must live in THIS file, not netlify.toml: Netlify evaluates a _redirects
# file's rules as a complete block before netlify.toml's [[redirects]] are
# ever consulted, so a rule placed only in netlify.toml is shadowed by this
# file's own /* 404 catch-all below, regardless of ordering within netlify.toml.
# 301 (not 302) per spec — this is a pure edge redirect (no page renders on
# our domain), so it gives no independent click count on its own; see the
# accompanying PR note on that gap.
#
# Editorial placements land SOFTER than card placements, per Strategy's ruling
# 2026-09-01. A card reader has already been told what Cost Seg Smart is and is
# clicking a CTA, so /order/ matches their intent. A reader who met the firm
# mid-paragraph in an article, or who clicked a link labelled "costsegsmart.com"
# on the author page, has not been sold anything yet -- dropping them on an
# order form is a scent break, and the click it wastes is worse than no click
# because it burns the referral without a conversion.
#
# These are specific paths listed BEFORE the :placement rule below, which
# Netlify resolves first-match-wins, so the shared card behaviour is untouched
# by design -- rewiring :placement itself would have changed the cards too.
# Same ref code, same four UTMs, same per-placement attribution; only the
# landing page differs.
/costseg/intel-article https://costsegsmart.com/?ref=MARKETICS-Q0DZ&utm_source=marketics&utm_medium=partner&utm_campaign=costseg&utm_content=intel-article    301!
/costseg/author-page   https://costsegsmart.com/?ref=MARKETICS-Q0DZ&utm_source=marketics&utm_medium=partner&utm_campaign=costseg&utm_content=author-page      301!

/costseg/:placement    https://costsegsmart.com/order/?ref=MARKETICS-Q0DZ&utm_source=marketics&utm_medium=partner&utm_campaign=costseg&utm_content=:placement    301!
/costseg               https://costsegsmart.com/order/?ref=MARKETICS-Q0DZ&utm_source=marketics&utm_medium=partner&utm_campaign=costseg&utm_content=direct         301!

